e":"衛瓘","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002:m0159","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"source_attested"},{"start":162,"end":163,"surface":"瓘","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002:m0162","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"source_attested"},{"start":171,"end":172,"surface":"瓘","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002:m0171","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"source_attested"},{"start":184,"end":185,"surface":"充","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002:m0184","kind":"person","person_id":"jmv_vc4_gep_*AA","status":"source_attested"},{"start":188,"end":189,"surface":"妃","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002:m0188","kind":"person","person_id":"jmv_vc4_gep_*AAA","status":"source_attested"},{"start":192,"end":194,"surface":"衛瓘","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002:m0192","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"source_attested"},{"start":199,"end":200,"surface":"汝","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p002:m0199","kind":"person","person_id":"jmv_vc4_gep_*AAA","status":"source_attested"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison","book_id":"b-jinshu-031","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu031-jia-ws2479706-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002","text":"冏因眾心怨望，潛與離狐王盛、潁川王處穆謀起兵誅倫。倫遣腹心張烏覘之，烏反，曰：「齊無異志。」冏既有成謀未發，恐或泄，乃與軍司管襲殺處穆，送首於倫，以安其意。謀定，乃收襲殺之。遂與豫州刺史何勖、龍驤將軍董艾等起軍，遣使告成都、河間、常山、新野四王，移檄天下征鎮、州郡縣國，咸使聞知。揚州刺史郗隆承檄，猶豫未決，參軍王邃斬之，送首於冏。冏屯軍陽翟，倫遣其將閭和、張泓、孫輔出堮阪，與冏交戰。冏軍失利，堅壘自守。會成都軍破倫眾于黃橋，冏乃出軍攻和等，大破之。及王輿廢倫，惠帝反正，冏誅討賊党既畢，率眾入洛，頓軍通章署，甲士數十萬，旌旗器械之盛，震於京都。天子就拜大司馬，加九錫之命，備物典策，如宣、景、文、武輔魏故事。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0015","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0016","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"王盛","kind":"person","person_id":"lwd_93l_vo3","status":"contextual_provisional